Step 13: Virtual Threads (Java 21)

            If organization prefers synchronous coding style.
            
            Enable:

            @Bean
            TaskExecutor taskExecutor() {
            
                return new TaskExecutorAdapter(
                        Executors.newVirtualThreadPerTaskExecutor());
            }

Then : 

            CompletableFuture.supplyAsync(
                    () -> api1(),
                    executor);


      - Virtual threads allow:    100,000+ concurrent requests    with simple code.

